  "question": {
    "text": "The number of distinct real roots of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;in the interval <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>&#8804;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math> is:"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": true
